<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS PLACE NO BIDS AT NBP REVREPO.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS PLACE NO BIDS AT NBP REVREPO.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banks did not place any bids at the National Bank of Poland's 300 million zloty 14-day reverse repo tender today, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
